[statement]
A dependency with a single candidate of a package whose condition holds
answers no name whose choice completes that condition, as it answers
others (`a-dependency-of-a-condition-that-will-hold-answers-an-earlier-name`):
`d` 3, the best candidate for `d`, completes `a`'s condition, and `a`
needs `v`, which only `d` 1 provides. apk takes `d` 3 and passes `a` over.

